'''Ghastly''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The whole knife is made up of an off blue ghastly aura, hence the name. The blade forms a gas swirl, with part of the dark turquoise guard crawling up the back of the bolster and spine. The handle is light turquoise, with a choppy dark turquoise layer going over it.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Ghastly (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

